{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38423","headline":"奉和御制六韵 · 吴融","name":"奉和御制六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天晓密云开，亭亭翠葆来。\n芰荷笼水殿，杨柳蔽风台。\n恩洽三时雨，欢腾万岁雷。\n日华偏照御，星彩迥分台。\n苇岸萦仙棹，莲峰倒玉杯。\n独惭歌圣德，不是侍臣才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}